# Device-access group for Android USB nodes. plugdev (GID 177) is
# seed-owned (accounts.tsv) for exactly this purpose; the declaration
# here is identical and converges. It also repairs the latent gap for
# every other consumer referencing plugdev: the seed row alone never
# materializes the group (proven absent on Egg despite the TSV row),
# and this fragment creates it wherever android-tools installs.
# No user, no daemon, no state: group-only, like libvirt.
group plugdev 177
